# Triple Triad: Bot1's upkeep exiles its Lightning Bolt (mana value 1) and Bot2's Burst Lightning (mana value 1). "Lesser mana
# value than it" is strictly less: the Burst Lightning, equal, may not be played. Bot1 plays nothing on turn 5, and the permission
# lasts "until end of turn": on Bot2's turn 6 the Bolt can no longer be cast from exile.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Triple Triad
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x9
Burst Lightning
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Triple Triad.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile.Count = 2
! Bot1.Exile.Burst Lightning.Cast(Bot2)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
! Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Exile.Count = 2
